    {
      "id": "doc-fabe393def40f0a691f14d",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "第一回合使用棋手技能选择卦象·节，二回合升2级，三回合升3级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 4,
          "paragraph_end": 4
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-984d2022f2d280c971abb2",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "开局棋手技能选择卦象·节，商店有弈星就买一张，没有就空城，第二回合先购买一张弈星再将棋手升至二级，三回合升3级。第一次拍卖：米莱狄>少司缘>朵莉亚> >苍（米莱狄优先级最高，越早在场，每回合整备额外叠加的等级越多）",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 16,
          "paragraph_end": 16
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-2d42fd9654d107894de97d",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "四-七回合，使用棋手技能选择卦象·丰，用免费刷新寻找朵莉亚、苍、少司缘、安琪拉、米莱狄，同名牌也要购买，到觉醒停手。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 5,
          "paragraph_end": 5
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-2d5177e0d404120ed7fc6e",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "有临阵磨枪需要买，等米莱狄觉醒后对其使用，可以增加召唤物等级（米莱狄一直在场，额外增加的临时等级相当于真实等级）。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 6,
          "paragraph_end": 6
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-eff66d6cb957dcdc45b67f",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "棋手三级，棋手技能选择卦象·丰，寻找朵莉亚、少司缘、苍、米莱狄，同名牌也需要购买，到觉醒停手。六回合的棋手技能选择增加等级的。第二次拍卖优先级，鲁班大师>雅典娜>杨玉环>露娜。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 18,
          "paragraph_end": 18
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-61ca15507e625b9b87fcb0",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "八-九回合，不论场上英雄是否觉醒，都要将棋手等级升至四级，卖掉弈星，寻找雅典娜，只买一张即可。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 7,
          "paragraph_end": 7
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-ea1e106d86bbe22e4445e9",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "十一回合，棋手等级升至五级，能量>5可以开棋手技能选择卦象·丰获得临时刷新，否则下回合再使用棋手技能，避免浪费刷新次数。最后一次拍卖还没有鲁班大师可以选择神兵天降找牌。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 8,
          "paragraph_end": 8
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-5b35761a1bfa3d2ef13721",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "多找临阵磨枪，全军动员，或者上阵露娜触发米莱狄整备，提升召唤物等级，这套阵容召唤物是主要伤害来源。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 9,
          "paragraph_end": 9
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-0736fa75b5bb3b130e7226",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "可以多利用合成寻找武装重构和武装分解，摧毁两件装备可以获得一件妙音，帮助鲁班大师觉醒。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-ad422be659dd9358c3aaba3c3beefa992e63b34e74b0daa71f875254f0c33106",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-2a8643e49cfb558b3a2392",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "八-九回合，无论场上英雄是否觉醒，都要将棋手升至四级。寻找雅典娜，只买一张即可，十一回合之后棋手升至5级，优先觉醒除了雅典娜以外的其余6名英雄。第十回合棋手技能选择增加等级的。十二回合之后，后续棋手技能均选择卦象·丰，获得临时刷新找牌。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
